ionalists: \u0022Nationalists\u0022\n PER_ultra_nationalists_long: \u0022Ultra-Nationalist Movement\u0022\n\n PER_islamic_council: \u0022Islamic Council\u0022\n PER_islamic_council_long: \u0022Islamic Council\u0022\n\n PER_qajar_dynasty_party: \u0022Qajar Dynasty\u0022\n PER_qajar_dynasty_party_long: \u0022Qajar Dynasty\u0022\n\n RAJ_eic_party_long: \u0022East India Company JSC\u0022\n RAJ_eic_party: \u0022EIC\u0022\n\n ASY_communism_party: \u0022ASP\u0022\n ASY_communism_party_long: \u0022Assyrian Socialist Party\u0022\n ASY_fascism_party: \u0022BM\u0022\n ASY_fascism_party_long: \u0022Babylon Movement\u0022\n ASY_democratic_party: \u0022Zowaa\u0022\n ASY_democratic_party_long: \u0022Assyrian Democratic Movement\u0022\n ASY_neutrality_party: \u0022ACOE\u0022\n ASY_neutrality_party_long: \u0022Assyrian Church of the East\u0022\n\n BHR_communism_party: \u0022NLF-B\u0022\n BHR_communism_party_long: \u0022Jabhat al-Tahrir al-Wathani - al-Bahrain\u0022\n BHR_fascism_party: \u0022Islamic Society\u0022\n BHR_fascism_party_long: \u0022Islamic National Tribune\u0022\n BHR_democratic_party: \u0022HAB\u0022\n BHR_democratic_party_long: \u0022Harakat Ahrar al-Bahrayn\u0022\n BHR_neutrality_party: \u0022Al-Khal\u012Bfah\u0022\n BHR_neutrality_party_long: \u0022the House of Khalifa\u0022\n\n IMO_communism_party: \u0022PFLO\u0022\n IMO_communism_party_long: \u0022al-Jabha as-Sa\u0027biyya li-Tahr\u012Br \u0027Um\u0101n\u0022\n IMO_fascism_party: \u0022IRF\u0022\n IMO_fascism_party_long: \u0022Imperial Revivalist Front\u0022\n IMO_democratic_party: \u0022ETO\u0022\n IMO_democratic_party_long: \u0022Elective Theocratic Organization\u0022\n IMO_neutrality_party: \u0022Elective Imamate\u0022\n IMO_neutrality_party_long: \u0022Ibadi Imamate Supporters\u0022\n\n PER_islamic_rep_party: \u0022Islamic Council\u0022\n PER_islamic_rep_party_long: \u0022Council of the Islamic Revolution\u0022\n\n emperor_fascism: \u0022Emperor Fascism\u0022\n emperor_fascism_desc: \u0022Emperor Fascism is a form of Ultranationalism in which the masses do not hold a say, often referred to as \u0027fascism from above\u0027, where the rule is held by the military and aristocratic bureaucrats, with great reverence for the nations emperor, a monarch who is regarded as an infallible divine figure.\u0022\n\n japan_militarism_ideology: \u0022Militarism\u0022\n japan_militarism_ideology_desc: \u0022Militarism is an ideology in which the leader of the nation holds only nominal control, and acts more like a puppet to the nation\u0027s military than an independent politician, constantly forwarding their agenda with the end goal of rapid expansionist policy.\u0022\n\n buddhist_socialism: \u0022Buddhist Socialism\u0022\n buddhist_socialism_desc: \u0022Buddhist socialism, also referred to as Dhammic or Natural socialism, is a political ideology which advocates socialism based on the principles of Buddhism. Both Buddhism and socialism seek to provide an end to suffering by analyzing its conditions and removing its main causes through praxis. Both also seek to provide a transformation of personal consciousness to bring an end to human alienation and selfishness.\u0022\n\n MEN_democratic_party: \u0022Ulanqab League\u0022\n MEN_democratic_party_long: \u0022The Ulanqab League\u0022\n MEN_communism_party: \u0022IMPRP\u0022\n MEN_communism_party_long: \u0022Inner Mongolian People\u0027s Revolutionary Party\u0022\n MEN_fascism_party: \u0022Chinggisid\u0022\n MEN_fascism_party_long: \u0022House Chinggisid\u0022\n MEN_neutrality_party: \u0022Pailingmiao Council\u0022\n MEN_neutrality_party_long: \u0022Mongol Local Autonomy Political Affairs Committee\u0022\n\n KUM_neutrality_party: \u0022Beig\u0022\n KUM_neutrality_party_long: \u0022Council of 12 Begs\u0022\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
