    {
      "Id": "la_crisis_polaca.2",
      "Type": "news_event",
      "Title": "la historia que conmovi\u00F3 alemanes",
      "Description": "This morning a story broke about a Polish girl who described losing her parents in a border conflict with Germany. Not only that, the girl described mistreatment and humiliation of civilians in the area, the worst part being that her parents weren\u0027t even soldiers. This story has already gone viral, and it is hoped that the efforts Germany has made to improve its relations with the British will soon be undone.",
